# Audit #17: the trained checkpoint is committed directly. It is ~16 MB (the
# pipeline asserts < 25 MB), well under GitHub's 100 MB file limit, so plain git
# is used instead of Git LFS: clones and Streamlit Community Cloud get the real
# weights with no LFS setup.
*.pth binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# Integrity sidecars stay as LF text so the SHA-256 line is byte-stable across OSes.
*.sha256 text eol=lf
